  "description": "Chae Seowon, a developer who left everything behind to return to his hometown after severe burnout. He only wanted to live a quiet life, but Seo Junghwan, a fleeting connection from his school days, suddenly reappears. Seowon struggles to trust people, while Junghwan gives his trust easily. \"I hope we see each other often.\" Despite trying to push him away, Junghwan's warmth draws closer, slowly making Seowon's heart waver. A spin-off featuring the story of Seo Junghwan, the reliable supporter from Frozen Boy.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/5341000435), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/5341000436)",
